  "solution": "Given equation: [{(44 + 36) - (4 × 4)} ÷ (1 - 5)] × 2 = 8 \n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) + and × \n\nGiven equation: [{(44 + 36) - (4 × 4)} ÷ (1 - 5)] × 2 = 8 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ [{**(44 × 36)** - **(4 + 4)**} ÷ **(1 - 5)**] + 2 = 8\n\n⇒ [**{1584 - 8}** ÷ (- 4)] + 2 = 8 \n\n⇒ ** ****[1576 ÷ (- 4****)]** + 2 = 8 \n\n⇒ **- 394**** +**** 2** = 8 \n\n⇒ - 392 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and ÷ \n\nGiven equation: [{(44 + 36) - (4 × 4)} ÷ (1 - 5)] × 2 = 8 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ [{**(44 ÷ 36)** - **(4 × 4)**} + **(1 - 5)**] × 2 = 8 \n\n⇒ [**{ 1.22**** - 16****}** + **(**-4**)**] × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ ** [-15.78 - 4****]** × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ -19.78 × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ - 39.56 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and -\n\nGiven equation: [{(44 + 36) - (4 × 4)} ÷ (1 - 5)] × 2 = 8 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ [{**(44 - 36)** + **(4 × 4)**} ÷ **(1 + 5)**] × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ [**{8 + 16} **÷ 6] × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ **[24 ****÷ 6] **× 2 = 8\n\n⇒ **4 × 2** = 8\n\n⇒ **8 = 8**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) × and ÷\n\nGiven equation: [{(44 + 36) - (4 × 4)} ÷ (1 - 5)] × 2 = 8 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ [{**(44 + 36)** - **(4 ÷ 4)**} × **(1 - 5)**] ÷ 2 = 8\n\n⇒ [**{****80 - 1}** × (-4)] ÷ 2 = 8\n\n⇒ **[****79 × (-4)****]** ÷ 2 = 8\n\n⇒ -316 ÷ 2 = 8\n\n⇒ -158 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
